)\n .setStyle(NotificationCompat.BigTextStyle().bigText(\"Notifications are working! You'll receive task reminders 1 day before tasks are due.\"))\n .setPriority(NotificationCompat.PRIORITY_HIGH)\n .setContentIntent(pendingIntent)\n .setAutoCancel(true)\n .build()\n\n notificationManager.notify(System.currentTimeMillis().toInt(), notification)\n }\n}\n"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"write","tool_call_id":"toolu_01CuPwFU3Qm3kUcSL2Yd7hWH","content":"Wrote contents to E:/AndroidStudioProjects/SmartTaskManager/app/src/main/java/com/example/smarttaskmanager/NotificationHelper.kt.

