ild Project\n```\n\n### Step 2: Uninstall Old Version\n```\nOn phone: Long press app → Uninstall\n```\n\n### Step 3: Install New Version\n```\nRun → Run 'app'\nor Install APK manually\n```\n\n### Step 4: Check\n```\nLook at home screen\nSee new professional logo! ✅\n```\n\n---\n\n## Logo Variations:\n\n### On Light Background:\n- Dark blue background with white badge\n- Clear contrast\n- Highly visible\n\n### On Dark Background:\n- Dark blue blends slightly\n- White badge stands out\n- Still professional\n\n### On Any Background:\n- Adaptive icon technology\n- Android adjusts automatically\n- Always looks good\n\n---\n\n## Where You'll See It:\n\n✅ **Home screen** - Main app icon \n✅ **App drawer** - All apps list \n✅ **Settings → Apps** - App info \n✅ **Notifications** - Small icon \n✅ **Recent apps** - Task switcher \n✅ **Play Store** (if published) \n✅ **Splash screen** (if used) \n\n---\n\n## Design Philosophy:\n\n### Principles Used:\n\n1. **Simplicity**\n - Clean, uncluttered\n - Easy to understand\n - Professional\n\n2. **Consistency**\n - Matches app colors\n - Unified brand\n - Cohesive design\n\n3. **Functionality**\n - Every element has meaning\n - Clear purpose\n - No decoration for decoration's sake\n\n4. **Professionalism**\n - Corporate-grade design\n - Business-appropriate\n - Trust-inspiring\n\n---\n\n## Design Inspiration:\n\n**Influenced by:**\n- ✅ Modern productivity apps\n- ✅ Microsoft To-Do\n- ✅ Todoist\n- ✅ Google Tasks\n- ✅ Apple Reminders\n\n**Design trend:**\n- Circular badges\n- Minimal typography\n- Meaningful icons\n- Professional color schemes\n\n---\n\n## Customization Options:\n\n### If You Want to Change Colors:\n\n**Edit:** `values/colors.xml`\n```xml\n<!-- Background color -->\n<color name=\"ic_launcher_background\">#YOUR_COLOR</color>\n```\n\n**Edit:** `drawable/ic_launcher_foreground.xml`\n```xml\n<!-- Badge color -->\nandroid:fillColor=\"#FFFFFF\"\n\n<!-- Text color -->\nandroid:fillColor=\"#001F4D\"\n\n<!-- Checkmark color -->\nandroid:fillColor=\"#4CAF50\"\n\n<!-- Lines color -->\nandroid:fillColor=\"#64B5F6\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Summary:\n\n**What You Get:**\n- Professional logo design\n- ⚫ Dark blue background (#001F4D)\n- ⚪ White circular badge\n- \"STM\" typography\n- ✅ Green checkmark (#4CAF50)\n- Blue task lines (#64B5F6)\n- Perfect for mobile\n- Adaptive icon\n- ⚡ Vector quality\n- Meaningful design\n\n**Design Goals Achieved:**\n- ✅ Professional appearance\n- ✅ Clear brand identity\n- ✅ Recognizable at any size\n- ✅ Matches app colors\n- ✅ Modern design language\n- ✅ Purpose-driven elements\n\n---\n\n## Result:\n\n**Your app now has a professional, modern logo that:**\n- Represents your brand (\"STM\")\n- Shows app purpose (checkmark + task lines)\n- Looks great on any device\n- Scales perfectly\n- Never pixelates\n- Matches your app design\n\n**Rebuild and reinstall to see your new professional logo!** ✨\n\n---\n\n## Next Steps:\n\n1. **Build** the app\n2. **Install** on your phone\n3. **Check** the home screen\n4. **Admire** your new professional logo!\n5. **Optional:** Adjust colors if needed\n\n**Your Smart Task Manager now has a logo that looks professional and polished!** \n"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"write","tool_call_id":"toolu_01KBpehL4NQsZPhs1M1kpGXk","content":"Wrote contents to E:/AndroidStudioProjects/SmartTaskManager/PROFESSIONAL_LOGO_CREATED.md.

